# ── Ignore non-essential files ──
node_modules
.next
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.env*
**/.env*
secrets
**/secrets
**/secrets/**
private
**/private
*.pem
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.keystore
*.jks
service-account*.json
**/service-account*.json
supabase
reviews
.review-logs
review-logs
logs
*.log
*_output.txt
*_progress.log
*_summary.md
scripts

# ── Markdown files (docs, README, etc.) ──
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT exclude *.md globally — content.md and content-free.md
# inside web/src/content/ are required at build time for Next.js.
README.md
AGENTS.md
CONTENT_GUIDELINES.md
docs
